Domain Study
Domain: Healthcare / Hospital Management

The project belongs to the Healthcare Information Management domain.

Understanding the Domain 

A hospital contains different departments and wards, each having multiple beds. A bed can have different states:

             Hospital
                |
       --------------------
       |        |         |
    General    ICU    Emergency
       |        |         |
    Beds      Beds      Beds
       |
 -------------------------
 |           |           |
Available  Occupied   Maintenance
Important Entities
Entity	Purpose
Hospital	Stores hospital information
Ward	Represents hospital departments/wards
Bed	Stores individual bed details
Patient	Stores patient information
Bed Allocation	Connects patient with a bed
Staff	Users who manage the system
Bed Status

You can use:

AVAILABLE
OCCUPIED
RESERVED
MAINTENANCE

Example:

Bed ID	Ward	Type	Status
B101	General	Normal	AVAILABLE
B102	General	Normal	OCCUPIED
ICU01	ICU	ICU	AVAILABLE
ICU02	ICU	ICU	MAINTENANCE
E01	Emergency	Emergency	RESERVED
3. Proposed Modules

