Module 1 — User Management
Admin login
Staff login
User roles
Module 2 — Hospital/Ward Management
Add ward
Update ward
Delete ward
View wards
Module 3 — Bed Management
Add bed
Update bed
Remove bed
View all beds
Search bed
Module 4 — Bed Availability Tracking
Available beds
Occupied beds
Reserved beds
Maintenance beds
